      "content": "Wait, you mentioned \"LibUtil\" as a high risk area. I thought the audit flagged a CVE in that specific library last week that looked pretty nasty. Can you be more specific about what exactly is wrong with the LibUtil integration? Is it just a patch job, or is there something deeper going on with how it's hooked into our core auth-module?",
